            "value" : "在电脑上开启「允许控制鼠标键盘」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View only: on the Mac, allow Accessibility in System Settings → Privacy & Security." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅查看：请在 Mac 的“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性”中允许辅助功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Desktop gestures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "桌面手势"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trackpad: drag anywhere to move the cursor. Direct touch: tap the target on screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触控板：在任意位置拖动以移动光标。直接触控：轻点屏幕上的目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap: left click. Double tap: double click. Two-finger tap or long press: right click." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点：左键单击。轻点两下：双击。双指轻点或长按：右键单击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap, then hold and drag: drag with the left mouse button. Two-finger swipe: scroll. Three-finger tap: keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点后按住并拖动：按住鼠标左键拖动。双指滑动：滚动。三指轻点：显示键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinch to zoom locally. In view-only mode, drag to pan the enlarged desktop. Each display remembers its zoom and position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双指缩放仅调整本地画面。仅查看模式下，可拖动平移放大的桌面。每台显示器分别记住缩放和位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control must be allowed on the host and for this device. The toggle only starts or stops this session’s control; it never changes host permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主机和此设备均须获准控制。开关仅开始或停止本次会话的控制，不会更改主机权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots open the system share sheet. Save to Files or share from there; no photo library access is requested." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "截图将打开系统分享面板，可存储到“文件”或分享，不会请求照片图库权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not share the screenshot. Check host screen recording permission and connection, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法分享截图。请检查主机的屏幕录制权限及连接，然后重试。"
